## Examples (MOST IMPORTANT)
- examples/workforce/simple_workforce_mcp.py
  - Shows: Creating a simple workforce with a single ChatAgent worker
  - Usage: Workforce class from camel.societies.workforce.workforce

- examples/models/openai_example.py
  - Shows: Creating and using OpenAI model with ChatAgent
  - Usage: ModelFactory.create with ModelPlatformType.OPENAI and ModelType.GPT_4O_MINI

- examples/models/gemini_model_example.py
  - Shows: Creating and using Gemini model with ChatAgent
  - Usage: ModelFactory.create with ModelPlatformType.GEMINI and ModelType.GEMINI_3_PRO

- examples/models/qwen_model_example.py
  - Shows: Creating and using Qwen model with ChatAgent
  - Usage: ModelFactory.create with ModelPlatformType.QWEN and ModelType.QWEN_3_CODER_PLUS

## Implementation
- camel/societies/workforce/workforce.py
  - Class: Workforce
  - Description: Core class managing multiple worker nodes (agents) cooperating to solve tasks, with task assignment, decomposition, and recovery strategies.

- camel/societies/workforce/single_agent_worker.py
  - Class: SingleAgentWorker (inherits Worker)
  - Description: Worker node consisting of a single ChatAgent, supports agent pooling for efficiency, structured output handling, and workflow memory management.

- camel/models/__init__.py
  - Exports: GeminiModel, OpenAIModel, QwenModel, ModelFactory, and many other model classes.

## Types/Enums
- camel/types/enums.py
  - Enum: ModelType (includes OpenAI, Gemini, Qwen model types)
  - Enum: ModelPlatformType (includes OPENAI, GEMINI, QWEN)

# Summary
To create a workforce with workers using OpenAI, Gemini, and Qwen models to discuss which model performs best, you can:
- Use the Workforce class from camel.societies.workforce.workforce
- Use SingleAgentWorker from camel.societies.workforce.single_agent_worker to create workers with ChatAgent instances
- Create ChatAgent instances with models created via ModelFactory.create() using ModelPlatformType and ModelType enums for OpenAI, Gemini, and Qwen
- Refer to examples/models/openai_example.py, gemini_model_example.py, and qwen_model_example.py for model usage patterns
- Refer to examples/workforce/simple_workforce_mcp.py for workforce creation and running example

These files provide the core classes, usage examples, and enums needed to implement the requested script.
